{"schema_version":"1.0","sample_id":"scale-alberto-hortelano-heroes-of-silence-0221","messages":[{"role":"user","content":"Implement the `shoot` function in TypeScript to simulate a battle between two stacks of creatures. The function should handle the following scenarios:\n\n1. **Shooting**: Decrease the number of shots left for the shooter.\n\n2. **Double Shot**: If the shooter has the trait 'double_shot', increase the number of shots to 2"},{"role":"assistant","content":"function shoot(state: BattleState, shooter: BattleStack, target: BattleStack, rng: Rng): void {\n  const info = creature(shooter.creature);\n  shooter.shotsLeft -= 1;\n  const shots = hasTrait(info, 'double_shot') ? 2 : 1;\n\n  for (let i = 0; i < shots && isAlive(target); i++) {\n    const distance = Math.min(\n      ...stackHexes(shooter).flatMap((sh) => stackHexes(target).map((th) => hexDistance(sh, th))),\n    );\n    const result = computeDamage(\n      shooter,\n      state.heroes[shooter.side],\n      target,\n      state.heroes[target.side],\n      rng,\n      { ranged: true, distance },\n    );\n    const killed = applyDamage(target, result.damage);\n\n    if (result.lucky) state.log.push({ kind: 'luck', stack: shooter.id, good: true });\n    state.log.push({\n      kind: 'shoot',\n      stack: shooter.id,\n      target: target.id,\n      damage: result.damage,\n      killed,\n    });\n    if (!isAlive(target)) state.log.push({ kind: 'perished', stack: target.id });\n\n    if (hasTrait(info, 'splash_shot')) splash(state, shooter, target, result.damage);\n  }\n}\n"}],"context":{"language":"TypeScript","provided_symbols":["BattleState","BattleStack","Rng"]},"metadata":{"source_repo":"alberto-hortelano/heroes-of-silence","source_commit":"39a68765ebe554c646d0d22d2f85ff8dc51d67ed","source_path":"src/core/battle/battle.ts","source_lines":"655-686","repository_family_id":"github-family:alberto-hortelano/heroes-of-silence","license":"MIT","category":"tactics","granularity":"G1","symbol":"shoot",