{"schema_version":"1.0","sample_id":"scale-rjct-react-isometric-game-0121","messages":[{"role":"user","content":"Implement the `useEntityInUnitHand` function in TypeScript, ensuring it adheres to the G1 code unit guidelines. The function should handle actions related to using an entity in a unit's hand, including checking for readiness, using the weapon, and consuming action points. It should also include error handling for invalid actions."},{"role":"assistant","content":"export function useEntityInUnitHand(state: GameMap, action: UseEntityInUnitHandReducerAction) {\n  const { unit, hand, targetPosition, consumeActionPoints } = action;\n\n  const weapon = unit.getCurrentWeapon();\n\n  if (weapon && weapon.isReadyToUse(state)) {\n    unit.inventory[hand]?.use(targetPosition, state);\n\n    if (consumeActionPoints) {\n      unit.consumeActionPoints(weapon.getCurrentAttackModeDetails().actionPointsConsumption);\n    }\n  }\n\n  return { ...state };\n}\n"}],"context":{"language":"TypeScript","provided_symbols":["GameMap","UseEntityInUnitHandReducerAction"]},"metadata":{"source_repo":"rjct/react-isometric-game","source_commit":"54135db4c36972533e3c05117ef43513dc1597b4","source_path":"src/reducers/game/unit/useEntityInUnitHand.ts","source_lines":"12-26","repository_family_id":"github-family:rjct/react-isometric-game","license":"MIT","category":"tactics","granularity":"G1","symbol":"useEntityInUnitHand","target_sha256":"df0c2d10a32d66bd06cf3f85b2c78fee583bff3debb2e06cb56f9ae74759a82d","generation":{"model":"Qwen/Qwen2.5-Coder-0.5B-Instruct","method":"code_to_instruction","decode":"greedy","parse_valid":true,"raw_output":"```json\n{\n  \"instruction\": \"Implement the `useEntityInUnitHand` function in TypeScript, ensuring it adheres to the G1 code unit guidelines. The function should handle actions related to using an entity in a unit's hand, including checking for readiness, using the weapon, and consuming action points. It should also include error handling for invalid a