{"schema_version":"1.0","sample_id":"scale-cbhead-deep-field-td-0383","messages":[{"role":"user","content":"Implement the `applySlow` function in TypeScript, following the provided signature and potential provided symbols. The function should handle the logic for applying slow effects based on the current time and the slow factor."},{"role":"assistant","content":"function applySlow(c: Creep, s: TowerStats): void {\n  if (s.slowSeconds <= 0 || s.slowFactor >= 1) return;\n\n  if (c.slowTimer <= 0 || s.slowFactor < c.slowFactor) c.slowFactor = s.slowFactor;\n  c.slowTimer = Math.max(c.slowTimer, s.slowSeconds);\n  // The ring reads `slowTimer / slowMax`, so the denominator has to grow with a\n  // refresh that extended the slow â€” otherwise a re-hit would show an arc\n  // stuck at full and the countdown would stop meaning anything.\n  c.slowMax = Math.max(c.slowMax, c.slowTimer);\n}\n"}],"context":{"language":"TypeScript","provided_symbols":["Creep","TowerStats","The"]},"metadata":{"source_repo":"cbhead/deep-field-td","source_commit":"a2bbdac19ea936c0e1eb9f4d0a3c5cbb576a64a5","source_path":"src/sim/systems/projectiles.ts","source_lines":"238-247","repository_family_id":"github-family:cbhead/deep-field-td","license":"MIT","category":"tower-defense","granularity":"G1","symbol":"applySlow","target_sha256":"e9af10fb86ddab67e9728c1b17a665708f08bb6db756c937fa66cd26a0409196","generation":{"model":"Qwen/Qwen2.5-Coder-0.5B-Instruct","method":"code_to_instruction","decode":"greedy","parse_valid":true,"raw_output":"```json\n{\n  \"instruction\": \"Implement the `applySlow` function in TypeScript, following the provided signature and potential provided symbols. The function should handle the logic for applying slow effects based on the current time and the slow factor.\"\n}\n```","batch_seconds":29.645},"independent_review":{"unit_id":"scale-cbhead-deep-field-td-0383","target_sha256":"e9af10fb86ddab67e9728c1b17a665708f08bb6db756c937fa66cd26a0409196","reviewer":"Qwen/Qwen2.5-Code